的相对性质。", "source_term": "relatively ample", "target_term": "相对丰沛"}, {"context": "限定开头给定的层。", "source_term": "invertible", "target_term": "可逆"}, {"context": "开头给定的对象。", "source_term": "sheaf", "target_term": "层"}, {"context": "开头问句中幂指数的取值类型。", "source_term": "integer", "target_term": "整数"}, {"context": "开头问句中要求该幂具有的相对性质。", "source_term": "relatively very ample", "target_term": "相对极丰沛"}, {"context": "第一个障碍所考虑的条件。", "source_term": "affine", "target_term": "仿射"}, {"context": "限定第一个障碍中所考虑的整数。", "source_term": "finite", "target_term": "有限"}, {"context": "第一个障碍中可能不存在满足要求的该类指数。", "source_term": "integer", "target_term": "整数"}, {"context": "第一个障碍中缺失的性质。", "source_term": "finite type", "target_term": "有限型"}, {"context": "第二个障碍中讨论拟紧性的对象。", "source_term": "base", "target_term": "基底"}, {"context": "第二个障碍中基底缺失的性质。", "source_term": "quasi-compact", "target_term": "拟紧"}, {"context": "第二个障碍中仍可满足的条件。", "source_term": "finite type", "target_term": "有限型"}, {"context": "构造所给定的对象。", "source_term": "field", "target_term": "域"}, {"context": "构造中在给定域上取的对象。", "source_term": "scheme", "target_term": "概形"}, {"context": "所取概形在给定域上的性质。", "source_term": "finite type", "target_term": "有限型"}, {"context": "所取概形上的可逆层具有的性质。", "source_term": "ample", "target_term": "丰沛"}, {"context": "限定所取概形上的丰沛层。", "source_term": "invertible", "target_term": "可逆"}, {"context": "所取概形上的对象。", "source_term": "sheaf", "target_term": "层"}, {"context": "用来比较何时达到极丰沛的各次幂。", "source_term": "tensor power", "target_term": "张量幂"}, {"context": "比较各张量幂时要求的性质。", "source_term": "very ample", "target_term": "极丰沛"}, {"context": "满足极丰沛要求的最小次幂。", "source_term": "power", "target_term": "次幂"}, {"context": "不交并中列出的源端对象。", "source_term": "schemes", "target_term": "概形"}, {"context": "由诸概形组成的源端对象。", "source_term": "disjoint union", "target_term": "不交并"}, {"context": "源端不交并到目标端不交并的映射。", "source_term": "mapping", "target_term": "映射"}, {"context": "由各个副本组成的目标端对象。", "source_term": "disjoint union", "target_term": "不交并"}, {"context": "下文引理给出的逆命题版本。"